or acquisition of entire share capital of Plant Health Care Pie, a England and Wales incorporated Company. This acquisition will be made through its newly incorporated wholly owned subsidiary,  Pl Industries Management Consultancies L.L.C. , Dubai and is subject to a court sanctioned scheme of arrangement under the applicable law, which is expected to be completed by Q2 FY25.There is no impact of the above acquisition In the current period results.   7 Segment information as per Ind AS 108  Operating Segments  is as per annexure I.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
